## Personal Notes
- Matplotlib was a bit **hard to grasp at first** – syntax felt verbose.  
- Seaborn became **easier to learn after Matplotlib** (it handles styling automatically).  
- Since I already knew NumPy & Pandas from Grade 12, I completed this step in **5 days**.  

